<title>HONG KONG: TABLE TENNIS-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the women's World Cup table tennis event on Monday:</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>Deng Yaping (China) beat Marie Svensson (Sweden) 21-13 21-14 21-11</p>
<p>Yang Ying (China) beat Wang Chen (China) 21-18 21-15 21-5</p>
<p>Third place play-off</p>
<p>Wang beat Svensson 23-21 21-15 (best of three)</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Deng beat Yang 21-18 21-18 21-17.</p>
